<title>DUBAI: TENNIS-IVANISEVIC TO DEFEND IN DUBAI.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-IVANISEVIC TO DEFEND IN DUBAI.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>World number three Goran Ivanisevic will defend his Dubai Open title next month, organisers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Boris Becker, ranked six, and Yevgeny Kafelnikov, four, are also in the entry.</p>
</text>
